<title>POLAND: POLISH JULY CPI FALLS 0.2 PCT - FINANCE MINISTER.</title>
<headline>POLISH JULY CPI FALLS 0.2 PCT - FINANCE MINISTER.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's July consumer price index (CPI) fell 0.2 percent against a 1.5-percent rise in June, finance ministry preliminary data showed.</p>
</text>
